{"seq":2,"slug":"first-aid","title":"高二体育 — 急救知识","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-2/sports-health/health-management/first-aid","wordCount":2400,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"高二体育-急救知识\">高二体育 — 急救知识</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>急救知识是每个人都应掌握的基本生存技能。在运动场上或日常生活中，意外伤害和突发疾病随时可能发生，专业医疗救援到达之前的&quot;黄金4分钟&quot;往往决定着伤病者的生死和预后。高中体育课将急救知识纳入教学内容，目的是让学生掌握心肺复苏（CPR）、止血包扎、骨折固定、运动损伤处理等基本技能。这些知识不仅在校园中有用，更是受益终身的公共安全素养。</p>\n<p>常见突发状况与急救优先级：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>紧急程度</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n<th>处理原则</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>生命威胁</td>\n<td>心脏骤停、严重出血、窒息</td>\n<td>运动中猝死、严重创伤</td>\n<td>立即处理，同时拨打120</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>严重损伤</td>\n<td>骨折、脱臼、头部外伤</td>\n<td>运动碰撞、高处坠落</td>\n<td>固定制动，等待急救</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一般损伤</td>\n<td>扭伤、拉伤、轻微出血</td>\n<td>运动中常见</td>\n<td>自行处理或送医</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内科急症</td>\n<td>中暑、低血糖、哮喘发作</td>\n<td>高温运动、空腹运动</td>\n<td>对症处理，必要时送医</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-心肺复苏-cpr\">一、心肺复苏（CPR）</h3><p>心脏骤停后，大脑在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4\\text{-}6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟内就会因缺氧发生不可逆损伤。及时有效的CPR能将心脏骤停患者的存活率提高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\text{-}3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 倍。</p>\n<p><strong>CPR操作流程</strong>（针对成人）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1. 判断意识</td>\n<td>拍打肩膀并大声呼唤</td>\n<td>&quot;你还好吗？&quot;双肩交替拍打</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2. 呼叫帮助</td>\n<td>拨打120，取AED</td>\n<td>让旁人帮忙拨打电话和取AED</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3. 判断呼吸</td>\n<td>观察胸廓起伏 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5\\text{-}10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 秒</td>\n<td>如无正常呼吸，立即开始CPR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4. 胸外按压</td>\n<td>30次按压</td>\n<td>位置：胸骨下半段；深度：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>6</mn><mtext>cm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5\\text{-}6\\text{cm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cm</span></span></span></span></span></span>；频率：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>120</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100\\text{-}120</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">120</span></span></span></span></span> 次/分钟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5. 开放气道</td>\n<td>仰头举颏法</td>\n<td>一手压前额，一手托下颌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6. 人工呼吸</td>\n<td>2次吹气</td>\n<td>捏住鼻子，口对口吹气，每次 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 秒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7. 持续循环</td>\n<td>30:2 循环</td>\n<td>直到AED到达、专业急救人员到场、或患者恢复呼吸</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>胸外按压的技术要求</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>按压位置：双手掌根叠放于胸骨下半段（两乳头连线中点）</li>\n<li>按压深度：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>6</mn><mtext>cm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5\\text{-}6\\text{cm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cm</span></span></span></span></span></span>（成人），不少于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mtext>cm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5\\text{cm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cm</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>按压频率：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>120</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100\\text{-}120</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">120</span></span></span></span></span> 次/分钟</li>\n<li>每次按压后充分回弹（让胸廓完全回复原位）</li>\n<li>尽量减少按压中断（中断不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 秒）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>AED（自动体外除颤器）的使用</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>打开AED电源</li>\n<li>按照语音提示和图示贴好电极片</li>\n<li>AED自动分析心律</li>\n<li>如果提示需要电击，确保无人接触患者后按下电击按钮</li>\n<li>电击后立即继续CPR</li>\n</ol>\n<p>AED是&quot;傻瓜式&quot;急救设备，即使没有医学背景也能操作。中国正在加速AED的公共场所布设（学校、机场、商场、地铁站等）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"二-常见出血的止血方法\">二、常见出血的止血方法</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>出血类型</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>危险程度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>动脉出血</td>\n<td>鲜红色，喷射状涌出</td>\n<td>危险，可短时间内大量失血</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>静脉出血</td>\n<td>暗红色，持续流出</td>\n<td>中等危险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>毛细血管出血</td>\n<td>渗出状，量少</td>\n<td>一般不危险</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>止血方法</strong>：</p>\n<p><strong>直接加压止血法</strong>（最常用、最有效）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>用清洁纱布或衣物直接压在伤口上</li>\n<li>持续用力按压至少 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\text{-}15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟</li>\n<li>不要频繁揭开查看（会破坏已形成的血凝块）</li>\n<li>如果渗透了第一层纱布，在上面再加一层继续按压</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>止血带法</strong>（仅用于四肢大出血且直接加压无效时）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在出血部位上方（靠近心脏一侧）绑扎止血带</li>\n<li>每 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>60</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30\\text{-}60</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟松开一次（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\text{-}2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟），防止肢体缺血坏死</li>\n<li>记录绑扎时间，告知急救人员</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"三-运动损伤的rice-police原则\">三、运动损伤的RICE/POLICE原则</h3><p>运动损伤（扭伤、拉伤、挫伤等）的急性期处理，从传统的RICE原则升级为POLICE原则：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字母</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>P</td>\n<td>Protection（保护）</td>\n<td>停止运动，保护受伤部位避免二次伤害</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OL</td>\n<td>Optimal Loading（适度负荷）</td>\n<td>在不加重损伤的前提下适度活动（替代了传统的Rest完全休息）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>I</td>\n<td>Ice（冰敷）</td>\n<td>冰袋包裹毛巾敷在伤处，每次 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15\\text{-}20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟，每 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 小时一次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>Compression（加压）</td>\n<td>用弹性绷带适度加压包扎，减少肿胀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E</td>\n<td>Elevation（抬高）</td>\n<td>将受伤部位抬高至心脏水平以上，促进血液回流</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>冰敷注意事项</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>不要将冰块直接接触皮肤（会导致冻伤）</li>\n<li>冰敷时间不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟</li>\n<li>受伤后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>48</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>72</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">48\\text{-}72</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">48</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">72</span></span></span></span></span> 小时内避免热敷（热会加重肿胀）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"四-骨折的现场处理\">四、骨折的现场处理</h3><p><strong>骨折的判断依据</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>明显的疼痛和肿胀</li>\n<li>受伤部位畸形或异常活动</li>\n<li>触摸有骨擦感</li>\n<li>患肢无法正常活动</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>现场处理原则</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>不要移动伤员</strong>（特别是疑似脊柱骨折时）</li>\n<li><strong>固定</strong>：利用夹板（木板、杂志、伞骨等硬物）固定骨折部位</li>\n<li>固定范围应超过骨折部位上下各一个关节</li>\n<li>夹板与肢体之间垫软物（毛巾、衣物）</li>\n<li><strong>开放性骨折</strong>（骨头刺穿皮肤外露）：不要将骨头推回，用无菌纱布覆盖伤口后固定</li>\n<li>拨打120等待专业救援</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"五-中暑的预防与处理\">五、中暑的预防与处理</h3><p>中暑是高温环境下体温调节功能障碍导致的急性热损伤。高温天气进行户外运动时尤其需要警惕。</p>\n<p><strong>中暑的三个阶段</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>症状</th>\n<th>处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>先兆中暑</td>\n<td>大汗、口渴、头晕、乏力</td>\n<td>转移到阴凉处，补充水和电解质</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>轻度中暑</td>\n<td>体温升高至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>38</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">38°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">38°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span> 以上、面色潮红、恶心</td>\n<td>迅速降温（冷水擦拭、风扇吹凉）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重度中暑（热射病）</td>\n<td>体温 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>40</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;40°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span>、意识障碍、抽搐</td>\n<td>紧急降温 + 立即拨打120（生命危险）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>中暑的预防</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>避免在最热的时段（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>11</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">11\\text{-}15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">11</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span> 时）进行剧烈户外运动</li>\n<li>运动前、中、后充分补水（每 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15\\text{-}20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟喝 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>150</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>200</mn><mtext>ml</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">150\\text{-}200\\text{ml}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">150</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ml</span></span></span></span></span></span>）</li>\n<li>穿着浅色、透气、吸汗的运动服</li>\n<li>循序渐进增加高温环境下的运动量（热适应至少需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>14</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7\\text{-}14</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">14</span></span></span></span></span> 天）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"六-其他常见急症处理\">六、其他常见急症处理</h3><p><strong>运动中低血糖</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>症状：心慌、出冷汗、手抖、头晕、乏力</li>\n<li>常见于空腹运动或长时间运动</li>\n<li>处理：立即停止运动，口服含糖食物（糖果、果汁、葡萄糖）</li>\n<li>预防：运动前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\text{-}2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 小时进食碳水化合物</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>运动性哮喘</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>症状：运动中或运动后出现喘息、呼吸困难、咳嗽</li>\n<li>处理：停止运动，使用随身携带的支气管扩张剂（沙丁胺醇吸入剂）</li>\n<li>预防：运动前充分热身，避免在冷空气中剧烈运动</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>肌肉痉挛（抽筋）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>最常发生在小腿腓肠肌</li>\n<li>处理：缓慢拉伸痉挛肌肉（如小腿抽筋时将脚尖向胫骨方向扳）</li>\n<li>同时按摩痉挛部位</li>\n<li>预防：充分热身、注意补水和电解质、避免过度疲劳</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>鼻出血</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>处理：身体前倾（不要后仰），用拇指和食指捏住鼻翼两侧 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\text{-}15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟</li>\n<li>可以在鼻梁处冰敷帮助止血</li>\n<li>如果 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟后仍出血不止，需就医</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>两人一组在人体模型或枕头上练习CPR的按压手法，互相评估按压位置、深度和频率是否正确。</li>\n<li>模拟场景练习：一名同学假装在跑步时扭伤了脚踝，另一名同学按照POLICE原则进行处理。</li>\n<li>调查你所在学校是否配备了AED，如果有，它安装在什么位置？如果没有，写一份建议书。</li>\n<li>设计一张&quot;运动急救卡片&quot;（正反两面），正面印常见运动损伤的处理流程，反面印CPR步骤，随身携带。</li>\n<li>讨论：为什么说&quot;黄金4分钟&quot;如此重要？如果路人都不会CPR会发生什么？公众急救教育的意义是什么？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>中国红十字会和各地急救中心定期开展公众CPR培训课程，建议在高中期间至少参加一次实操培训并获得急救员证书。</li>\n<li>美国心脏协会（AHA）发布的《心肺复苏和心血管急救指南》是CPR操作标准的全球权威来源。</li>\n<li>AED的位置可以通过&quot;救命地图&quot;等手机App查询（如&quot;AED地图&quot;微信小程序）。</li>\n<li>运动医学教科书中关于运动损伤的章节提供了更详细的损伤机制和康复方案。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>急救知识是&quot;为自己和他人的生命负责&quot;的基本能力。心肺复苏（CPR）和AED使用是最关键的急救技能——在心脏骤停的&quot;黄金4分钟&quot;内实施有效CPR，可以将存活率提高数倍。运动损伤的POLICE原则（保护、适度负荷、冰敷、加压、抬高）是处理扭伤拉伤的标准流程。此外，中暑预防、低血糖处理、止血包扎等技能在校园体育活动中随时可能用到。急救不是医生的专利，每一个掌握急救知识的普通人都可能成为挽救生命的&quot;第一响应者&quot;。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高二体育 — 急救知识","id":"高二体育-急救知识"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、心肺复苏（CPR）","id":"一-心肺复苏-cpr"},{"level":3,"text":"二、常见出血的止血方法","id":"二-常见出血的止血方法"},{"level":3,"text":"三、运动损伤的RICE/POLICE原则","id":"三-运动损伤的rice-police原则"},{"level":3,"text":"四、骨折的现场处理","id":"四-骨折的现场处理"},{"level":3,"text":"五、中暑的预防与处理","id":"五-中暑的预防与处理"},{"level":3,"text":"六、其他常见急症处理","id":"六-其他常见急症处理"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高二体育 — 青少年健康","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-2/sports-health/health-management/adolescent-health"},"next":{"title":"高二体育 — 生活方式与健康","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-2/sports-health/health-management/lifestyle-health"}}